#: kcm/backupplanwidget.cpp:546
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Make the destination folder identical to the source folder. Files deleted "
"from a source folder will be deleted from the backup folder as well.<nl/><nl/"
">This can prevent data loss due to a broken disk, but not due to files being "
"accidentally deleted or changed."
